      "name": "Camel's Back Road",
      "city": "Mussoorie",
      "description": "One of Mussoorie's most picturesque stretches named after a naturally formed rock resembling a camel's hump. Offers magnificent mountain vistas, fresh pine-scented air, and panoramic views of the Doon Valley. Ideal for families with young children.",
