    {
      "name": "Cloud's End",
      "city": "Mussoorie",
      "description": "Located at the western edge of Mussoorie, surrounded by dense oak and deodar forests. Offers quiet walking trails, cool mountain breeze, and uninterrupted valley panoramas. Best experienced during daylight hours.",
